# Rebuild-under-fire's first arm ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 1):
# the Impossible base with rebuild 5000 -- a razed pool is re-claimed only
# once the rival's army value has dropped 5,000 below its recent peak, the
# smaller of the two drop scales the strike search measured as a real
# window-opener. Everything else is flame-nocover exactly.

name imp-rebuild5k
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 2
close 3
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 5000
hunt 0
brace 0
huntgate 0
bank 0
